\f1\fs22 Chanta couldn\'92t let it go. That night, he snuck out of his suite, to the service lift. Its truck-width doors opened as soon as he summoned it. Inside, he ran a finger over the schematic of floor choices on the wall. At the bottom was a box labelled 
\fs20 BUNKER
\fs22  that surrounded floor options: 
\fs20 PLANT
\fs22 , 
\fs20 STAFF
\fs22 , 
\fs20 PROVISIONING
\fs22  and three levels underneath labelled 
\fs20 RESIDENCE
\fs22 .\
